= Page breaks

The first sheet ends after this paragraph: a page break follows (plan P3-14).

#pagebreak()

The second sheet starts here, though the first had room.

#!aside(style: {break: {before: "page"}})
A region that starts a sheet of its own.
#aside!

#!note(style: {media: "screen"})
Shown on screen only.
#note!

#!note(style: {media: "paged"})
Printed only: this paragraph has no place on screen.
#note!
